{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, grab it and process it. Else, approach and move, finally scan for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToPosition    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
